<title>USA: Interactive Flight names Metzler president.</title>
<headline>Interactive Flight names Metzler president.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interactive Flight Technologies Inc said Tuesday that it had named Tom Metzler its president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Metzler was most recently president and chief executive of AMR Services, an affiliate of AMR Corp's American Airlines, the company said.</p>
<p>The president and chief operating jobs had been handled by Interactive's chairman and chief executive, Michail Itkis. Itkis will remain chairman and chief executive after Metzler joins, a company spokesman said.</p>
